sort [k desc]
└─ project (k) (rows≈7 cost≈288)
   └─ aggregate keys=[k] (rows≈7 cost≈232)
      └─ union-all (rows≈7 cost≈176)
         ├─ project (k) (rows≈5 cost≈80)
